SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                100000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  10000
PrintEvery                    1000

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

ComputeEnergyHistogram        yes
WriteEnergyHistogram          yes

Framework 0
FrameworkName framework
UnitCells 2 2 1
HeliumVoidFraction 0.877
ExternalTemperature 300.0
ExternalPressure 0.0

Component 0 MoleculeName       nitrogen
            MoleculeDefinition local
            CreateNumberOfMolecules 1
            TranslationProbability 1.0
            ReinsertionProbability 1.0
            SwapProbability 0.0
            IdentityChangeProbability 0.0
            NumberOfIdentityChanges 0
            IdentityChangesList 0
            NumberOfIdentityChanges 0
            CBMCProbability 0.0
            ExternalTemperature 300.0
            ExternalPressure 0.0

